'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[light armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be bought from the [[Dust Devils Premium Warbond|Dust Devils]] page on the [[Superstore]] for {{Currency|Super Credits|300|notext}} and 150 [[Super Credits]], respectively.

